+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Semantic Versioning (major.minor.patch) for release versioning. The rationale recorded is that tracking API compatibility matters more than signaling publication date: Semantic Versioning lets consumers see the scope of an upgrade at a glance, with breaking changes communicated explicitly through major version bumps.
